      "_note": "jobs.a16z.com is server-rendered (18,000+ portfolio jobs): one search per api_query, 25 results by relevance, each card with the posting's own date, location, pay and the company's ATS apply link. Checked 2026-10-15: no page parameter works (start/p return mostly the same 25). Results are by relevance, not date, so a 2-day window keeps only a handful: window_days keeps the recent fortnight and new-since-last-run marks the rest.",
      "window_days": 14
