      "_seed_note": "Boards the sweep reads from the first run, before any role link points at them. These are the web3 employers with public Greenhouse/Lever/Ashby boards verified on 2026-10-15; sector tags the company for the autopilot's pay estimate. Chainlink, Polygon, Ledger and the foundations use private ATSs and are reached through the Getro crypto boards and web3.career instead."
